h translations for the interface, menus, and gameplay hints.Russian and English subtitles for audio logs, announcements, and story dialogue.The option to switch between Russian and English in the menu.A subtitle toggle that remembers your preference.Chinese localization is also in development. We’ll share more when it’s ready.If you notice a translation issue or a problem with subtitles, please let us know in the Steam discussions. Your feedback helps us improve","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T17:24:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687554","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677100-1838407329268517","game_id":"steam-4677100","kind":"update","title":"Update 1.1.1 Beta Is Now Available","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the game, participated in testing, reported bugs, and shared feedback. Your reports help us identify problems and continue improving the game.Main ChangesAudioAdded a dedicated audio settings menu.The volume of different sound categories can now be adjusted separately.Added a new ambient track.OptimizationGeneral project optimization has been carried out.Reduced the rendering workload.Optimized shaders and materials.Added further improvements aimed at increasing ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T09:10:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329268517","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:57:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4677100-1836506165583376","game_id":"steam-4677100","kind":"announcement","title":"In Tenebris Demo is Now Available","summary":"Unfortunately, English localization is not available in the current demo build yet. We are already working on it, and in the 